{"id":"007003ee8e93187664ca65ca5ef06a1d356ee0c2","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1237008","title":"GPT 网页版没法连续工作了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"xujinkai","excerpt":"OpenAI - @xujinkai - 感觉网页版智商最高，就聊天模式，昨天前天我是可以跟网页版讨论方案，然后我说实施，他能在 GitHub 上开个新分支连续提交几十个 commit ，干的又快又好。今天早上起来网页版只会划水了，我","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>感觉网页版智商最高，就聊天模式，昨天前天我是可以跟网页版讨论方案，然后我说实施，他能在 GitHub 上开个新分支连续提交几十个 commit ，干的又快又好。</p>\n<p>今天早上起来网页版只会划水了，我说实施他就把方案再重复一遍，光动嘴不干活了，传奇程序员落幕了。</p>\n<p>你要问我为啥不用 codex ，因为网页版智商最高。</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/网页版\"><li></li> 网页版</a><a href=\"/tag/工作\"><li></li> 工作</a><a href=\"/tag/能力\"><li></li> 能力</a></P><p><span>6 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-25 16:47:48 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014639\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ee92fc40a6c8ab3e4ebba24675b6e8e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vultr\" data-uid=\"188988\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vultr\">vultr</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:30:08 +08:00\">21h 57m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>bug 总会修复的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014687\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fa70/42da/194163_normal.png?m=1749184790\" alt=\"potatowish\" data-uid=\"194163\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/potatowish\">potatowish</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:36:17 +08:00\">21h 51m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>因为又降智了，上周都降智到 5.5mini 了，昨天恢复了，今天又开始了。 最近准备上新模型了，时不时要把网页端算力调配过来用一用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18014722\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/602a/1e42/177637_normal.png?m=1785677912\" alt=\"xujinkai\" data-uid=\"177637\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xujinkai\">xujinkai</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 11:39:18 +08:00\">21h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哎，他网页版那个工作能力，算到额度里我也能接受，按量充钱我也能接受，但用着用着成弱智了我就很难受😭</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18015937\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/51d9/fe87/117741_normal.png?m=1783257267\" alt=\"sskycn\" data-uid=\"117741\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sskycn\">sskycn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-25 15:30:53 +08:00\">17h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的能用，应该只是你自己的被限制了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18016395\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e9df3812a997f3f22ee335fa1bbc5a84?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"shuijingwanwqyy\" data-uid=\"808002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p